-- WHAT THESE ARE
--
-- Numbers printed on a named page of a named report, with the verbatim line
-- they came from stored alongside them. Not measurements of the economy —
-- most are surveys of executives, model simulations or scenarios, and each
-- figure's own `note` says which.
--
-- NONE OF THESE HAS BEEN CHECKED BY A PERSON YET. Every row lands as
-- `figure_source = 'extracted'` and renders saying so. Promoting one is a
-- single UPDATE once the page has been read:
--
--     UPDATE report_figures SET figure_source = 'reviewed' WHERE id = '...';
--
-- `SELECT * FROM unreviewed_figures` is the worklist.
-- ============================================================================

