   '%', 0, 'category',
   'A quarterly executive survey of 2,145 senior leaders, fielded online 28 April to 25 May 2026. These are attitudes, not outcomes: ''AI is delivering meaningful business value'' is a leader''s own assessment, and KPMG defines it loosely as productivity gains, cost savings, revenue growth or better decision-making — the report separately shows only 7% claim established ROI. The two waves are separate samples, so the point changes are between-sample differences, not tracked change within the same firms.', 'p. 9', 'Organizations are becoming more confident in AI''s strategic value ... To what extent do you agree or disagree with the following statements? Percentage who agree/strongly agree Q1 (n=2110), Q2 (n=2145)',
   24)
